DESCRIPTION:u19 create your world is the youth category of the Prix Ars Ele
 ctronica\, for young people in Austria working with digital media\, techno
 logy\, games\, code\, film\, music\, art and design. Individuals\, project
  groups and school projects may enter.\n\nOrganisation: Ars Electronica (P
 rix Ars Electronica)\nLocation: Linz\, Austria\; open only to people aged 
 19 or younger who live in Austria on 3 March 2027\nAward: Young Profession
 als (14 to 19): Golden Nica EUR 3\,000\, two Awards of Distinction EUR 800
  each\, ten Honorary Mentions. Young Creatives (up to 14): per age group (
 u10\, u12\, u14) one EUR 500 Prize plus an Award of Distinction (EUR 150 f
 or u14\, EUR 100 for u12 and u10). No entry fee mentioned.\nDuration: One-
 off prize\n\nMore: https://ars.electronica.art/createyourworld/en/prix/?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
