 pportunities/topic-search?keywords=CERV-2026-CITIZENS-REM&utm_source=artif
 icialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:EU Member States (incl. OCTs) and CERV-associated countries. Lead 
 applicant must be a non-profit legal entity or international organisation.
END:VEVENT
