SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 CET: NLnet Foundation: Open Call January 2027 (Resta
 ck\, CodeSupply and general fund)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 03 Jan 2027 at 12:00 CET.\n\nNLnet's January 2027 open c
 all (deadline 3 January 2027\, 12:00 CET\; the proposal form may open shor
 tly) funds open-source technical development: software and hardware releas
 ed under free licenses.\n\nOrganisation: Stichting NLnet (with European Co
 mmission backing\; successor to the NGI Zero programme)\nLocation: Remote 
 / worldwide. Individuals\, informal collectives\, nonprofits\, SMEs and un
 iversities from any country\; EU-backed funds want a European dimension\, 
 and applicants outside Horizon Europe countries must explain the fit.\nAwa
 rd: EUR 5\,000 to 50\,000 for a first grant\, scalable in follow-ups\; the
  Restack fund alone will award EUR 7 million through 2030. No application 
 fee.\nDuration: Project-based\, typically up to about 12 months per plan\;
  calls recur roughly every two months.\n\nMore: https://nlnet.nl/propose/?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://nlnet.nl/propose/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
LOCATION:Remote / worldwide. Individuals\, informal collectives\, nonprofit
 s\, SMEs and universities from any country\; EU-backed funds want a Europe
 an dimension\, and applicants outside Horizon Europe countries must explai
 n the fit.
END:VEVENT
