SUMMARY:Deadline 14:00 CET: VI Premio a la Mejor Tesis Doctoral en Humanida
 des Digitales (HDH and Fundación BBVA)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 08 Jan 2027 at 14:00 CET.\n\nPrize for the best doctoral
  thesis in digital humanities\, awarded by the Hispanic Digital Humanities
  society with Fundación BBVA. The thesis must have been defended at a Spa
 nish university between 1 January and 31 December 2025\; current HDH board
  members are excluded. Applications open 11 November 2026 and close 8 Janu
 ary 2027\, 14:00 Spanish peninsular time.\n\nOrganisation: Sociedad Intern
 acional de Humanidades Digitales Hispánicas (HDH) with Fundación BBVA\nL
 ocation: Spain. For PhD theses defended at Spanish universities\; national
 ity and residence do not matter.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 plus a diploma (subjec
 t to tax withholding). No application fee.\nDuration: One-off prize\n\nMor
 e: https://www.fbbva.es/premios/vi-premio-mejor-tesis-doctoral-humanidades
 -digitales?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.fbbva.es/premios/vi-premio-mejor-tesis-doctoral-humanidades
 -digitales?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Spain. For PhD theses defended at Spanish universities\; nationali
 ty and residence do not matter.
END:VEVENT
