  Farm supporting New York State artists to complete or present new sound a
 nd moving-image works\, including work with emergent technologies. Exclude
 s full-time students\, applicants to the 8 July 2026 NYSCA Support for Art
 ists round\, and music projects (including electronic music)\; the artist 
 fee can be at most 15% of the request.\n\nOrganisation: Wave Farm (NYSCA r
 egrant)\nLocation: New York State (Wave Farm is in Acra\, NY). New York St
 ate residents only.\nAward: Up to USD 7\,500. No application fee.\nDuratio
 n: Project-based\n\nMore: https://wavefarm.org/grants-services/nysca-regra
 nts/maaf-artists/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referra
 l
