SUMMARY:Deadline: Sundance Episodic Lab 2027: Alfred P. Sloan Grant Track (
 science and technology series)
DESCRIPTION:An extended Sloan-only round of the Sundance Episodic Lab for o
 riginal half-hour or one-hour series whose subject is science\, technology
  or mathematics\, or a scientist\, engineer or mathematician. Open to a wr
 iter or a two-person writing team. Submit via FilmFreeway (fee waived with
  the published code) by 3 December 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Sundance Institu
 te with the Alfred P. Sloan Foundation\nLocation: Los Angeles / Park City\
 , USA\nAward: USD 17\,000 grant plus creative support through the Episodic
  Lab. Submission fee waived with code EpSloanGrantX121426 on FilmFreeway.\
 nDuration: Episodic Lab 2027\n\nMore: https://filmfreeway.com/SundanceEpis
 odicLab2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
