SUMMARY:Deadline: Belfer Center Technology and Geopolitics Fellowship 2027-
 28 (Harvard Kennedy School)
DESCRIPTION:Residential fellowships for doctoral candidates past general ex
 ams and PhDs (usually within five years) working on technology and geopoli
 tics: AI\, quantum\, cyber\, technology regulation\, emerging technology a
 nd democracy\, and US-China competition. Apply by 1 December 2026\; letter
 s due 15 December.\n\nOrganisation: Belfer Center for Science and Internat
 ional Affairs\, Harvard Kennedy School\nLocation: Cambridge\, Massachusett
 s\, USA\nAward: Stipend up to about USD 70\,000 (predoctoral) or USD 80\,0
 00 (postdoctoral)\, plus small travel and research grants. No application 
 fee.\nDuration: Academic year 2027-28\n\nMore: https://www.belfercenter.or
 g/fellowship/technology-and-geopolitics?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
